# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.langtest).
# The owner's black-screen path, end to end: Sileo opened, its alert dismissed, its settings
# sheet opened by the avatar and scrolled to Language, the language screen opened, Apply Changes
# tapped, and the alert's destructive button (the relaunch) tapped -- Sileo then fades its
# window and exits; the URL opens it again. The runner takes a screenshot every two seconds and
# the window server's audit says in the log whether the display was opaque black.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 6
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 25 tap 0.32 0.601 wait 4 tap 0.32 0.601 wait 4
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.9 0.14 wait 12 swipe 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.3 300 wait 2 swipe 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.3 300 wait 2
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.30 0.841 wait 12
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.77 0.10 wait 6 tap 0.677 0.565 wait 10
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 10
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 40
